    {
      "source_number": "995",
      "modern_number": "995",
      "group": "第41小节",
      "source_pages": ["p0299#4"],
      "original_text": "995. 求下列各式的值：а) $x^2-4x+3$，设$x=2+\\sqrt{3}$；б) $x^2-3x+5$，设$x=\\frac{3+\\sqrt{2}}{2}$。",
      "task_count": 2,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "task_id": "995-a",
          "source_label": "а",
          "modern_label": "a",
          "expression": "x^2-4x+3",
          "given": "x=2+sqrt(3)",
          "derivation": [
            "x^2-4x+3=(x-2)^2-1.",
            "At x=2+sqrt(3), x-2=sqrt(3).",
            "(sqrt(3))^2-1=3-1=2."
          ],
          "result": "2"
        },
        {
          "task_id": "995-b",
          "source_label": "б",
          "modern_label": "b",
          "expression": "x^2-3x+5",
          "given": "x=(3+sqrt(2))/2",
          "derivation": [
            "x^2-3x+5=(x-3/2)^2+11/4.",
            "At x=(3+sqrt(2))/2, x-3/2=sqrt(2)/2.",
            "(sqrt(2)/2)^2+11/4=1/2+11/4=13/4."
          ],
          "result": "13/4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_number": "996",
      "modern_number": "996",
      "group": "第42小节",
      "source_pages": ["p0299#6"],
      "original_text": "996. 用图解法解下列方程：а) $x^2=5x-8$； б) $x^2=\\frac{1}{2}x+5$；в) $2x^2-3x-10=0$； г) $x^2+2x-14=0$；д) $x^2-x+12=0$； е) $x^2+6x-16=0$。",
      "task_count": 6,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "task_id": "996-a",
          "source_label": "а",
          "modern_label": "a",
          "statement": "x^2=5x-8",
          "method": "graphical",
          "graph": {
            "parabola": "y=x^2",
            "parabola_vertex": ["0", "0"],
            "line": "y=5x-8",
            "line_slope": "5",
            "line_y_intercept": "-8",
            "vertical_gap": "x^2-(5x-8)=(x-5/2)^2+7/4",
            "intersections": [],
            "position_evidence": "The parabola is strictly above the line for every real x: the vertical gap is at least 7/4>0. There is no intersection abscissa."
          },
          "result": {
            "real_roots": [],
            "solution_set": "empty set"
          }
        },
        {
          "task_id": "996-b",
          "source_label": "б",
          "modern_label": "b",
          "statement": "x^2=x/2+5",
