            "intersection_derivation": "At a crossing, 2(x-3/4)^2=89/8, hence (x-3/4)^2=89/16 and x=(3-sqrt(89))/4 or x=(3+sqrt(89))/4.",
            "intersections": [
              {"x": "(3-sqrt(89))/4", "y": "(49-3*sqrt(89))/4"},
