            "position_evidence": "Write r_minus=(3-sqrt(89))/4 and r_plus=(3+sqrt(89))/4. The gap is 2(x-r_minus)(x-r_plus). The parabola is below the line between these crossings and above it outside them; at x=0 it has height 0 while the line has height 10."
