            "Independently, p^2+1>=1>0 for every real p.",
            "A strictly positive numerator divided by a strictly positive denominator is strictly positive.",
            "(p^2-6p+18)/(p^2+1)=((p-3)^2+9)/(p^2+1)>0."
          ],
