    {
      "source_number": "1001",
      "modern_number": "1001",
      "group": "第43小节",
      "source_pages": ["p0300#4"],
      "original_text": "1001. 利用配出一个二项式的平方的方法：а) 证明$x^2-8x+27$的最小值是11；б) 求$a^2-4a+20$的最小值。",
      "task_count": 2,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "task_id": "1001-a",
          "source_label": "а",
          "modern_label": "a",
          "statement": "Prove that the minimum of x^2-8x+27 is 11.",
          "domain": "x in R",
          "method": "completing_square",
          "derivation": [
            "x^2-8x+27=x^2-8x+16+11=(x-4)^2+11.",
            "(x-4)^2>=0, so the value is always at least 11.",
            "The square equals zero if and only if x=4.",
            "At x=4 the expression is 16-32+27=11, so the lower bound is attained."
          ],
          "result": {
            "minimum": "11",
            "attained_exactly_when": "x=4"
          }
        },
        {
          "task_id": "1001-b",
          "source_label": "б",
          "modern_label": "b",
          "statement": "Find the minimum of a^2-4a+20.",
          "domain": "a in R",
          "method": "completing_square",
          "derivation": [
            "a^2-4a+20=a^2-4a+4+16=(a-2)^2+16.",
            "(a-2)^2>=0, so the value is always at least 16.",
            "The square equals zero if and only if a=2.",
            "At a=2 the expression is 4-8+20=16, so this is a minimum, not merely an unattained lower bound."
          ],
          "result": {
            "minimum": "16",
            "attained_exactly_when": "a=2"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_number": "1002",
      "modern_number": "1002",
      "group": "第44小节",
      "source_pages": ["p0300#6"],
      "original_text": "1002. 解下列方程：а) $4x^2+7x+3=0$； б) $x^2+x-90=0$；в) $x^2-x-90=0$； г) $5x^2-18x+16=0$；д) $8x^2+x-75=0$； е) $3x^2-11x-14=0$；ж) $3x^2+11x-34=0$； з) $x^2-x-1=0$。",
      "task_count": 8,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "task_id": "1002-a",
          "source_label": "а",
          "modern_label": "a",
          "statement": "4x^2+7x+3=0",
          "derivation": [
            "4x^2+7x+3=(4x+3)(x+1).",
            "(4x+3)(x+1)=0 if and only if 4x+3=0 or x+1=0.",
            "Thus x=-3/4 or x=-1."
          ],
          "result": {"real_roots": ["-1", "-3/4"]}
        },
        {
          "task_id": "1002-b",
          "source_label": "б",
          "modern_label": "b",
          "statement": "x^2+x-90=0",
          "derivation": [
            "x^2+x-90=(x+10)(x-9).",
            "(x+10)(x-9)=0 if and only if x=-10 or x=9."
          ],
          "result": {"real_roots": ["-10", "9"]}
        },
        {
          "task_id": "1002-c",
          "source_label": "в",
          "modern_label": "c",
          "statement": "x^2-x-90=0",
          "derivation": [
            "x^2-x-90=(x-10)(x+9).",
            "(x-10)(x+9)=0 if and only if x=10 or x=-9."
          ],
          "result": {"real_roots": ["-9", "10"]}
        },
        {
          "task_id": "1002-d",
          "source_label": "г",
          "modern_label": "d",
          "statement": "5x^2-18x+16=0",
          "derivation": [
            "5x^2-18x+16=(5x-8)(x-2).",
            "(5x-8)(x-2)=0 if and only if x=8/5 or x=2."
          ],
          "result": {"real_roots": ["8/5", "2"]}
        },
        {
          "task_id": "1002-e",
          "source_label": "д",
          "modern_label": "e",
          "statement": "8x^2+x-75=0",
          "derivation": [
            "8x^2+x-75=(8x+25)(x-3).",
            "(8x+25)(x-3)=0 if and only if x=-25/8 or x=3."
          ],
          "result": {"real_roots": ["-25/8", "3"]}
        },
        {
          "task_id": "1002-f",
          "source_label": "е",
          "modern_label": "f",
          "statement": "3x^2-11x-14=0",
          "derivation": [
            "3x^2-11x-14=(3x-14)(x+1).",
            "(3x-14)(x+1)=0 if and only if x=14/3 or x=-1."
          ],
          "result": {"real_roots": ["-1", "14/3"]}
        },
        {
          "task_id": "1002-g",
          "source_label": "ж",
          "modern_label": "g",
          "statement": "3x^2+11x-34=0",
          "derivation": [
            "3x^2+11x-34=(3x+17)(x-2).",
            "(3x+17)(x-2)=0 if and only if x=-17/3 or x=2."
          ],
          "result": {"real_roots": ["-17/3", "2"]}
        },
        {
          "task_id": "1002-h",
          "source_label": "з",
          "modern_label": "h",
          "statement": "x^2-x-1=0",
          "derivation": [
            "With coefficients 1,-1,-1, the discriminant is (-1)^2-4*1*(-1)=5>0.",
            "The quadratic formula gives x=(1-sqrt(5))/2 or x=(1+sqrt(5))/2.",
            "Equivalently, x^2-x-1=(x-1/2)^2-5/4; both signs of sqrt(5)/2 are retained."
          ],
          "result": {"real_roots": ["(1-sqrt(5))/2", "(1+sqrt(5))/2"]}
        }
      ]
